menu "Moonwater"
    config MOONWATER_CORE
        tristate "Moonwater core"
        default y
        help
          Enable the Moonwater core: the spark binary format, /dev/spark and the compositor

    config MOONWATER_DISPLAY
        bool "Moonwater in-kernel compositor"
        depends on MOONWATER_CORE && DRM && DRM_CLIENT
        default y
        help
          Own the display from kernel space: the compositor draws the
          desktop, windows and cursor itself through the in-kernel DRM
          client API rather than handing a device node to a userspace
          display server.
endmenu # Moonwater
